<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>Sound Effects SAMI Subtitle</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P { font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt; color: white; background-color: black; text-align: center; }
.ENUSCC { Name: English; lang: en-US; SAMIType: CC; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>

<SYNC Start=0>
<P Class=ENUSCC>[MUSIC] Intro music playing softly.</P>

<SYNC Start=3000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>[APPLAUSE] The audience claps enthusiastically.</P>

<SYNC Start=6000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>[LAUGHTER] Everyone bursts into laughter.</P>

<SYNC Start=9000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>[DOOR CREAKING] A door slowly opens.</P>

<SYNC Start=12000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>[THUNDER RUMBLING] Storm sounds in background.</P>

<SYNC Start=15000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>[BIRDS CHIRPING] Morning ambiance outside.</P>

<SYNC Start=18000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>[PHONE RINGING] A phone rings urgently.</P>

<SYNC Start=21000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>[FOOTSTEPS] Someone walks down the hallway.</P>

<SYNC Start=24000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>[WIND HOWLING] Strong winds blow outside.</P>

<SYNC Start=27000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>[GLASS BREAKING] A window shatters loudly.</P>

</BODY>
</SAMI>
